WEBVTT

00:10.093 --> 00:12.053
DIARY, TANJIRO KAMADO

00:28.737 --> 00:29.863
Come on.

02:03.706 --> 02:04.916
DESTROY

02:04.999 --> 02:09.462
The Demon Slayer Corps
with hundreds of members

02:10.088 --> 02:14.008
is an organization that is not recognized
by the government.

02:14.551 --> 02:19.472
It has existed since ancient times
dedicated to hunting demons to this day.

02:20.682 --> 02:24.978
However, whoever leads
the Demon Slayer Corps

02:25.061 --> 02:27.021
remains shrouded in mystyery.

02:27.981 --> 02:29.190
Demons.

02:29.941 --> 02:34.362
They mainly prey on human beings
by killing and devouring them.

02:34.988 --> 02:38.199
We don't know when or where
they will appear.

02:38.408 --> 02:40.410
Their bodies are so powerful

02:40.493 --> 02:43.121
that any wound on them
can completely heal in a blink of an eye.

02:43.788 --> 02:45.999
They can reconnect
their severed body parts

02:46.124 --> 02:49.002
and they can even grow new limbs.

02:49.544 --> 02:53.214
With the ability to transform,
demons thrive with supernatural abilities.

02:53.756 --> 02:55.216
Only sunlight

02:55.341 --> 02:59.596
or blades with special powers
to behead them can kill them.

03:00.555 --> 03:04.517
The Demon Slayer Corps
confront demons in flesh and blood.

03:05.059 --> 03:06.519
As they are humans,

03:06.603 --> 03:11.399
they heal slowly from their injuries
and cannot restore their severed limbs.

03:11.858 --> 03:17.071
Yet they still fight against demons
for the sake of humanity.

03:30.835 --> 03:32.587
I am your trainer.

03:33.463 --> 03:35.965
As the title suggests,
my job is to train swordsmen.

03:36.799 --> 03:38.509
There are plenty of trainers out there.

03:39.010 --> 03:40.428
In their respective regions,

03:40.553 --> 03:43.765
they train swordsmen
in their own respective ways.

03:44.474 --> 03:46.351
In order to join the corps,

03:46.601 --> 03:52.273
one must take part in the Final Selection
which is held at Fujikasane Mountain.

03:52.732 --> 03:55.318
Whether you'll join
the Final Selection or not,

03:55.401 --> 03:56.527
that is up to me.

03:58.279 --> 03:59.614
In order to save Nezuko,

04:00.073 --> 04:02.533
I keep a diary starting today.

04:03.243 --> 04:05.286
I also have to practice running downhill.

04:05.995 --> 04:08.039
If I don't want to die
at the Final Selection,

04:08.122 --> 04:09.290
I need to work hard.

04:13.753 --> 04:16.547
As I train myself running downhill
over and over every day,

04:16.965 --> 04:19.759
I get better and better
at dodging traps and pitfalls.

04:20.593 --> 04:22.679
As my physical strength improves,

04:22.887 --> 04:25.223
my sense of smell
has become keener than before

04:25.431 --> 04:27.642
to the point that I can tell apart
different kinds of scents.

04:29.769 --> 04:30.812
However,

04:32.939 --> 04:35.233
the traps only get harder.

04:36.776 --> 04:39.112
He's absolutely trying to kill me.

04:51.416 --> 04:54.252
Today, I'm running downhill with a sword.

04:54.794 --> 04:56.754
This is a real nuisance.

05:00.508 --> 05:02.260
As I carry a heavier burden,

05:02.510 --> 05:04.429
I keep falling into traps.

05:06.264 --> 05:07.598
991,

05:07.682 --> 05:09.976
-992, 993...
-Today, I learn to brandish my sword.

05:10.059 --> 05:11.853
-994, 995...
-He said it started today,

05:11.936 --> 05:13.688
but I've been training for that
every day prior.

05:13.980 --> 05:15.523
Every time after running downhill,

05:15.606 --> 05:17.650
I would train brandishing
until my hands fall off.

05:17.734 --> 05:19.027
1,000!

05:19.610 --> 05:21.571
Give me 500 more.

05:36.669 --> 05:38.796
Katanas snap off easily.

05:39.547 --> 05:41.591
That's what he told me early on.

05:42.675 --> 05:44.719
They are good at
sustaining perpendicular force,

05:45.136 --> 05:47.096
but the same can't be said
with horizontal force.

05:48.806 --> 05:52.518
So one must wield it
with full perpendicular force.

05:53.478 --> 05:54.812
The direction of the blade

05:54.937 --> 05:59.942
must be completely unanimous with
the direction of the brandishing force.

06:00.526 --> 06:02.695
Or else, it will damage the katana.

06:02.862 --> 06:05.573
In other words, if the katana breaks,

06:05.990 --> 06:08.201
so will your bones.

06:08.451 --> 06:10.203
That's some kind of warning from him.

06:13.831 --> 06:14.999
Nezuko,

06:15.583 --> 06:17.585
I'll do the best that I can.

06:33.518 --> 06:35.728
Today, it's the throwdown ceremony.

06:36.604 --> 06:39.148
No matter how you're thrown down,
you must sustain it properly

06:39.607 --> 06:41.400
and get back up fast.

06:42.652 --> 06:44.153
I raise my sword

06:44.529 --> 06:47.031
and throw it right at Master Urokodaki.

06:47.448 --> 06:51.369
While Master Urokodaki himself
is unarmed and unprotected.

06:54.205 --> 06:56.499
But he's outrageously strong.

06:57.041 --> 07:00.837
I keep getting thrown
onto the ground by him.

07:05.842 --> 07:07.593
I'm home, Nezuko.

07:17.854 --> 07:21.482
Today, I learned breathing techniques
and some sort of Breath Styles.

07:22.400 --> 07:24.527
Total Concentration Breathing?

07:25.653 --> 07:26.779
That's right.

07:27.029 --> 07:31.534
I'm going to pass down
all ten Breath of Water forms to you.

07:32.702 --> 07:36.330
Like letting oxygen run into all cells
in every part of your body,

07:36.414 --> 07:38.666
it's to concentrate your breathing
for a long period.

07:38.958 --> 07:41.335
This is to improve
your body's ability to heal

07:41.544 --> 07:44.547
and to stabilize and activate
your mind and spirit.

07:45.548 --> 07:48.092
Relax the upper half of your body

07:48.634 --> 07:51.095
and keep the lower half stable and still.

07:51.721 --> 07:53.347
Good. Now, breathe.

07:58.478 --> 07:59.729
That's not the way.

08:01.814 --> 08:03.441
Now, Breath Styles.

08:04.108 --> 08:05.860
Right, is it like this?

08:05.943 --> 08:06.903
No.

08:06.986 --> 08:08.112
This?

08:08.196 --> 08:09.030
No.

08:09.113 --> 08:10.448
-This?
-No.

08:10.531 --> 08:12.158
-This?
-No.

08:12.283 --> 08:15.119
He rebuked me for not exerting
strength from my abdomen.

08:15.286 --> 08:17.330
He punched my belly many times.

08:18.414 --> 08:22.376
Then, he instructed me
to be one with water.

08:22.919 --> 08:24.337
Get down there now.

08:30.092 --> 08:33.721
Nezuko!

08:38.726 --> 08:40.394
Nezuko!

08:40.478 --> 08:43.189
I am water!

08:46.025 --> 08:50.780
Meanwhile, Nezuko has been unconscious
for over six months.

08:51.948 --> 08:55.034
Master Urokodaki promptly invited
a doctor to inspect her,

08:55.493 --> 08:56.827
but he couldn't find the problem.

08:58.037 --> 09:01.457
But it's strange
when she keeps sleeping on.

09:06.462 --> 09:07.630
I was scared.

09:08.798 --> 09:10.049
What if

09:10.716 --> 09:13.469
I wake up one morning to find Nezuko dead?

09:14.887 --> 09:17.890
Yes, I was frightened every day.

09:26.732 --> 09:28.776
Downhill training has become
more dangerous.

09:28.985 --> 09:31.320
I have to train where the air is thin.

09:38.452 --> 09:41.414
There were so many instances
where I thought I was going to die.

09:58.639 --> 10:01.475
There is no more that I can teach you.

10:02.727 --> 10:04.770
A year has passed
since I arrived at Sagiri Mountain

10:05.187 --> 10:06.606
and suddenly he told me this.

10:08.524 --> 10:10.443
It's all up to you from now on.

10:10.901 --> 10:14.697
Let's see if you can master and improve
on everything I've taught you.

10:19.160 --> 10:20.202
Follow me.

10:38.596 --> 10:40.806
If you can split this rock into two,

10:40.890 --> 10:43.934
I'll allow you to join
the Final Selection.

10:48.814 --> 10:50.232
Can I...

10:51.108 --> 10:52.360
cut a rock?

10:53.277 --> 10:55.196
Can I do that with a katana?

10:56.238 --> 10:57.740
I don't think I can.

10:58.324 --> 10:59.700
It'll snap my katana.

11:05.539 --> 11:08.125
Master Urokodaki, please wait.

11:08.292 --> 11:09.710
Master Urokodaki!

11:11.462 --> 11:16.967
Since then, Master Urokodaki
stopped instructing me for good.

11:43.369 --> 11:47.790
Every day, I practiced repeatedly
everything I learned from my master.

11:55.214 --> 11:58.300
With a basic grasp on blocking energy
and maintaining a flexible body,

11:58.426 --> 12:00.761
I was glad to write them down in my diary.

12:10.771 --> 12:13.691
Yet another six months have passed

12:13.983 --> 12:15.651
and I'm still unable to cut the rock.

12:16.610 --> 12:19.155
This makes me worried
that I haven't done enough

12:19.530 --> 12:21.115
and I'm still not tough enough.

12:21.740 --> 12:23.117
So I have to work out harder.

12:23.534 --> 12:24.410
Even harder...

12:32.585 --> 12:35.171
Am I too weak for this?

12:36.297 --> 12:38.340
Is Nezuko going to die just like that?

12:40.801 --> 12:42.887
I'm so discouraged that I want to quit.

12:44.805 --> 12:47.224
I must work harder! Harder!

12:48.434 --> 12:49.351
Shut up.

12:55.357 --> 12:57.109
Real men don't whine.

12:57.193 --> 12:58.277
You'll look bad.

12:58.903 --> 13:00.070
When did he show up?

13:00.321 --> 13:02.907
This man in the fox mask,
I couldn't smell him.

13:03.741 --> 13:06.494
No matter how tough it gets,
you must bear it in silence.

13:07.536 --> 13:09.246
If you are a man,

13:11.165 --> 13:13.125
and if you live as a man...

13:22.092 --> 13:25.721
You're sluggish, feeble and immature.

13:27.348 --> 13:29.975
Thus, you're not a real man.

13:33.812 --> 13:35.481
What are you doing here?

13:36.148 --> 13:38.859
I was about to ask you the same thing.

13:39.527 --> 13:41.987
I'm training, of course.

13:42.363 --> 13:45.282
How long are you going
to stay on the ground?

13:45.533 --> 13:47.159
You don't even have protection.

13:51.205 --> 13:53.624
Well, show me what you got.

13:54.208 --> 13:56.544
But your sword is a wooden sword.

13:56.627 --> 13:58.003
Mine is a real one.

14:13.310 --> 14:14.979
My goodness.

14:15.062 --> 14:17.982
I'm so grateful for your consideration.

14:18.566 --> 14:22.444
You really think you can hurt me.

14:24.989 --> 14:27.366
You may have a lot of compassion,

14:27.658 --> 14:31.912
but I'm stronger than you
because I can cut that rock!

14:32.371 --> 14:33.914
You can cut the rock?

14:51.307 --> 14:53.601
You haven't learned anything.

14:53.809 --> 14:56.103
You simply haven't made
anything into yours.

14:57.229 --> 15:00.691
Especially the breathing technique
that Master Urokodaki taught you,

15:01.025 --> 15:03.152
Total Concentration Breathing.

15:04.486 --> 15:06.196
He knows Master Urokodaki?

15:06.906 --> 15:08.198
Even the breathing technique.

15:08.741 --> 15:12.161
All you did was memorize it
in the form of knowledge.

15:12.870 --> 15:15.789
You didn't impart any of it
into your body.

15:16.874 --> 15:20.085
What have you been doing
in the past year and a half?

15:22.588 --> 15:25.424
I'm going to make all of that
stick into your flesh and blood.

15:26.342 --> 15:29.637
More!

15:29.803 --> 15:34.892
I'll make you never forget every essence
of what Master imparted upon you.

15:35.351 --> 15:37.895
I'm going to nail it all
right into your bones!

15:38.103 --> 15:39.355
I trained.

15:39.772 --> 15:41.357
I trained every day.

15:41.565 --> 15:42.566
I gave my all.

15:43.025 --> 15:45.569
But it got me nowhere at all.

15:46.070 --> 15:49.198
So I can't move on.

15:49.782 --> 15:50.741
Move on then!

15:50.824 --> 15:51.909
If you're a man,

15:52.451 --> 15:54.119
and if you live as a man,

15:54.620 --> 15:56.580
as long as you haven't run
into a dead end,

15:56.872 --> 15:57.957
give me all you got.

15:58.248 --> 16:00.793
Show me all your might!

16:18.268 --> 16:19.937
Now you take care of him.

16:33.033 --> 16:34.410
Are you okay?

16:36.996 --> 16:38.580
Did you see it too?

16:40.040 --> 16:41.667
It was a big blow.

16:41.750 --> 16:43.836
How did he do it? It was flawless.

16:44.211 --> 16:45.921
It was really beautiful.

16:46.338 --> 16:48.382
I want to be just like that.

16:48.590 --> 16:50.509
Can I do it like him?

16:53.303 --> 16:54.555
Of course you can.

16:54.972 --> 16:56.807
Because I'll watch over you.

17:01.770 --> 17:03.313
You're so cute.

17:04.523 --> 17:06.275
Who are you?

17:08.318 --> 17:11.238
Her name is Makomo.

17:12.114 --> 17:15.325
She told me that the boy is Sabito.

17:16.118 --> 17:19.997
After that, Makomo went on
to point out my weaknesses.

17:20.956 --> 17:23.042
She helped me to correct
my unnecessary moves,

17:23.208 --> 17:25.294
get rid of my bad habits and many more.

17:26.587 --> 17:28.464
Why does she want to help me?

17:28.797 --> 17:32.009
I asked her where she came from,
but she refused to answer.

17:33.761 --> 17:37.765
We absolutely love Master Urokodaki.

17:38.515 --> 17:41.727
That's what Makomo always said.

17:42.770 --> 17:44.396
They are not siblings.

17:44.897 --> 17:48.192
Apparently, they are orphans
adopted by Master Urokodaki.

17:49.109 --> 17:52.362
There are other kids around here too.

17:52.696 --> 17:55.115
Everyone is watching you, Tanjiro.

17:56.617 --> 17:59.953
Makomo is a little strange.

18:00.871 --> 18:02.831
She spoke in vague words.

18:04.124 --> 18:06.418
As for Total Concentration Breathing,

18:06.835 --> 18:11.215
it can increase your blood circulation
and speed up the pulse of your heart.

18:11.924 --> 18:14.968
That is so your body will get warmer

18:15.344 --> 18:18.430
and you'll be strong as a demon
even you're still human.

18:19.431 --> 18:22.518
In short, it makes your lungs bigger

18:23.393 --> 18:26.855
and lets more and more air
into your blood.

18:27.106 --> 18:28.899
When your blood goes into shock,

18:29.441 --> 18:33.445
your bones and muscles heat up rapidly
making you stronger.

18:34.404 --> 18:36.156
I don't quite get her.

18:37.282 --> 18:39.284
What should I do to achieve that?

18:42.579 --> 18:44.456
Work out with all your might.

18:44.706 --> 18:48.627
Besides that, I don't see
any other way to achieve it.

18:51.880 --> 18:55.175
It feels like my arms and legs
have crumbled into pieces.

18:55.717 --> 18:58.846
My lungs and heart
are about to explode soon.

18:59.221 --> 19:00.556
Yet I train hard with my sword.

19:01.431 --> 19:02.432
Even so,

19:03.767 --> 19:05.352
I still can't beat Sabito.

19:08.355 --> 19:11.024
Another six months have passed.

19:19.533 --> 19:22.286
On that very day, I challenged Sabito.

19:22.870 --> 19:24.705
He waited for me with his sword.

19:25.497 --> 19:27.166
It has been half a year.

19:28.792 --> 19:30.669
You're sporting the face of a real man.

19:38.969 --> 19:40.679
I will beat you today.

19:48.228 --> 19:50.647
A face-to-face combat is very simple.

19:51.273 --> 19:54.651
The stronger and faster of the two wins.

20:07.748 --> 20:09.708
It was decided in a blink of an eye.

20:11.376 --> 20:13.962
This day, on this very instant,

20:14.296 --> 20:17.466
my blade touched Sabito first.

20:28.227 --> 20:29.770
As I secured my victory,

20:30.812 --> 20:32.189
Sabito smiled.

20:33.273 --> 20:35.984
He seemed to be crying
and happy at the same time.

20:36.652 --> 20:38.695
It looked like a smile of relief.

20:40.656 --> 20:41.698
Tanjiro.

20:43.075 --> 20:44.660
Well done.

20:44.868 --> 20:46.578
Don't forget your performance just now.

20:48.830 --> 20:50.791
Be sure to win, Tanjiro.

20:51.166 --> 20:52.417
Beat him for us.

20:59.508 --> 21:02.386
As I turned around,
Sabito disappeared too.

21:05.472 --> 21:08.267
The sword I used to split Sabito's mask...

21:16.108 --> 21:18.902
has split the rock too.

22:55.373 --> 22:56.792
Even I was surprised.

22:56.875 --> 22:58.668
I managed to cut a big rock in two.

22:58.877 --> 23:01.046
This is all thanks to Sabito and Makomo.

23:01.213 --> 23:02.839
It's right for me to show them
some gratitude.

23:04.382 --> 23:07.135
Here's a little gossip
from the Taisho era.

23:07.594 --> 23:10.222
Do you know why Master Urokodaki
wears a mask?

23:10.388 --> 23:11.431
I heard that

23:11.515 --> 23:15.852
it's because he looks so affable
that demons mock him all the time.

23:16.103 --> 23:18.980
Sabito, Makomo and Master Urokodaki,

23:19.439 --> 23:22.901
I'll do my best to turn Nezuko
back into a human.

23:24.402 --> 23:27.030
Next, episode 4, "Final Selection."

23:27.114 --> 23:28.115
TO BE CONTINUED

23:28.198 --> 23:29.282
Subtitle translation by CL Tan
